/target
/dist

# Local replica + deploy state written by icp-cli. A normal project ignores only
# .icp/cache/ and keeps .icp/data/, which records the canister IDs of mainnet
# deployments. This repo never deploys to mainnet (only local replicas — e.g.
# examples deployed in place by their e2e tests), so the whole .icp/ is disposable.
.icp/

# canbench's cached PocketIC runtime binary (~100 MB), downloaded on first run.
# The committed baseline is canbench_results.yml, not this cache.
.canbench/

# Local working/planning doc, not a repo artifact (was committed by accident).
BENCHMARKING.md
